2026-07-27T09:34:15.3871057Z i /tmp/Rtmp0ISjFZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:34:15.3871303Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:34:15.3871763Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:34:15.3872005Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:34:15.3872381Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:34:15.3872931Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:34:15.3873511Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
